{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "直避，別本均作真譬，今依高麗古本改正。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "大沙門，即比丘及比丘尼，此總攝二部大僧。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "終"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "每至黑白月十五日清晨，知事稟白堂頭，今日誦戒\n和尚令侍者命書記書簡，輪請闍黎。知事送簡入闍\n黎寮，問訊出，命直日者在比丘堂前擊鐘，或擊鼓三\n\n下，集諸比丘，依戒次列定。輪差二比丘，一人執香，一\n人執磬，入闍黎寮迎。闍黎陞座迎請，率諸比丘禮三\n拜。闍黎係是菩薩尊臘，不必謝眾。若是比丘，便當謝\n眾，如菩薩戒本。前後同迎請侍座坐，舉讚"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "稽首禮諸佛，引請擊魚，同闍黎梵舉"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "戒序并問清淨法，闍黎鳴尺白"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "比丘戒相，梵舉逐句同誦"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "誦畢，引請送闍黎歸寮，諸比丘入和尚方丈禮拜。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "女力切，音匿。蟲食病。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "他代切，音貸。態度也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "烏含切，音庵。知也，熟聞也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "音輭，同蝡，\n蟲行貌。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "音祇。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "悉委切，骨中脂也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "音逸。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "音徹，每事即然也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "常利切，音\n視。嗜欲喜之也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "胡谷切，音斛。輕紗細縛也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "委遠切，音宛。纁色衣。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "以然切，冕前後垂覆"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "所交切，音筲。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "敷勿切，音髴。拂去塵埃也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "尺絹切，臂環也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "戶關切，音還。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "桑何切，音梭。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "湯臥切，口液也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "如欲切，音辱。坐褥也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "音耳，食也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "初親切，音襟。䞋\n錢也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "陟草切，音謫。手取也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "巨偃切，音鍵。限門也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "直追切，音追。擊也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "丘閑切，悋\n也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "莫見切，音󱌁。麥末也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "謨官切，音瞞。麪食也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "力弔切，音料。療治也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "才爵切，齧\n也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "語綺切，與蟻同。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "戶瓦切，音跨。足踝也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "音贊，汙洒也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "陟教切，籠也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "耶果切，赤體也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "音慮。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "音幾，蝨子也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "音瑟，齧人蟲也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "初莊切，音倉。瘡痍也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "息淺切，音鮮。乾瘍也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "丁括切，音掇。補裰破衣也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "質涉切，摺疊也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "音韜，纓飾也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "初親切，音襯。近身衣也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "魯果切，赤體也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "勿發切，音韈。足衣也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "音莊，粉飾也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": "cf1", "text": "X60n1121_p0437b01"}
